					"content": "来，让我看看你们都挖出了点啥？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710631102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "老臭"
				},
				{
					"id": 710631102,
					"content": "哦，你们居然把这袋东西挖出来了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710631103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "老臭"
				},
				{
					"id": 710631103,
					"content": "里面是什么呀…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710631104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 710631104,
					"content": "啊这些首饰，看上去真是…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710631105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 710631105,
					"content": "好丑。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710631106
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710631106,
					"content": "就是盗宝团之前那些人做出来的，根本卖不出去。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710631107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "老臭"
				},
				{
					"id": 710631107,
					"content": "不过好歹算是真材实料，把那上面的宝石抠下来也能值点钱…哎…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710631108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "老臭"
				},
				{
					"id": 710631108,
					"content": "你们就把这个送给老唐吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710631109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "老臭"
				},
				{
					"id": 710631109,
					"content": "那我们就先走了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710631110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 710631110,
					"content": "嘿，要是有空的话，再来我这玩挖宝啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710631111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "老臭"
				},
				{
					"id": 710631111,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}，我们现在就回去吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
		},
